                "text": "Following COVID, food insecurity in NYC is unacceptably high, with many unable to get the sustenance or nutrition they need.\n\nI was honored to deliver an $175,000 grant to expand @RethinkFood's cutting edge food pantry program that connects New Yorkers with nutritious meals. https://t.co/HhMv7CQ3a4",
