                "text": "Last year New York City refunded nearly $30 million in stolen SNAP benefits. That authority expires at the end of September.\n\nWe cannot allow fraudsters to deprive New Yorkers of the nutrition they need.\n\nI am fighting to ensure Congress extends this lifeline to working families. https://t.co/DqOXMEZguW",
