                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Sixty years ago, the Food Stamp Act founded the food nutrition program now known as SNAP.\n\nToday, one in seven New Yorkers rely on SNAP to put food on their table.\n\nDespite Rs constant attempts to cut SNAP, I will always fight to expand and protect this essential program.",
